<!doctype html>
<html>
<head>
    <meta charset="utf-8">
    <title>Connecter Spotify</title>
    <style>
        body {
            font-family: 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif;
            background-color: #121212;
            color: #FFFFFF;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            align-items: center;
            height: 100vh;
            margin: 0;
            text-align: center;
        }
        .container {
            max-width: 500px;
            padding: 40px;
            background-color: #181818;
            border-radius: 12px;
            box-shadow: 0 8px 16px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3);
        }
        h1 {
            font-size: 2.5em;
            color: #1DB954;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }
        p {
            font-size: 1.1em;
            line-height: 1.6;
            margin-bottom: 30px;
        }
        .spotify-btn {
            display: inline-block;
            padding: 15px 30px;
            background-color: #1DB954;
            color: #FFFFFF;
            font-size: 1.2em;
            font-weight: bold;
            text-decoration: none;
            border-radius: 500px;
            transition: background-color 0.3s ease;
        }
        .spotify-btn:hover {
            background-color: #1ED760;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="container">
        <h1>Connecter votre compte Spotify</h1>
        <p>Pour générer vos widgets personnalisés, vous devez autoriser notre application à accéder à vos données d'écoute Spotify.</p>
        <a href="<%= authUrl %>" class="spotify-btn">Autoriser avec Spotify</a>
    </div>
</body>
</html>